{"fps": 30, "frames": 2726, "lines": [{"id": "l01", "who": "A", "scene": "problem", "show": "Claude! I built a website, but the design looks terrible. And I don't even know if everything works!", "start": 0.15, "end": 5.615, "sf": 4, "ef": 168}, {"id": "l02", "who": "C", "scene": "arrive", "show": "Hey, don't worry! Anthropic has Agent Skills that can help with exactly that.", "start": 5.835, "end": 10.507, "sf": 175, "ef": 315}, {"id": "l03", "who": "A", "scene": "what", "show": "Skills? What do they actually do?", "start": 10.727, "end": 12.551, "sf": 322, "ef": 377}, {"id": "l04", "who": "C", "scene": "what", "show": "They're reusable instructions and tools that teach me how to handle specific tasks, like designing websites, testing apps, and creating new workflows.", "start": 12.771, "end": 22.354, "sf": 383, "ef": 671}, {"id": "l05", "who": "C", "scene": "design", "show": "For your design problem, we can use the frontend-design skill. I ran it on your page. New fonts, colors and layout. It even fixed a bug: your order buttons updated an element that doesn't exist.", "start": 22.574, "end": 34.604, "sf": 677, "ef": 1038}, {"id": "l06", "who": "A", "scene": "design", "show": "Wait... that looks so much better!", "start": 35.624, "end": 37.235, "sf": 1069, "ef": 1117}, {"id": "l07", "who": "A", "scene": "testing", "show": "But how do I know the website actually works?", "start": 37.455, "end": 40.059, "sf": 1124, "ef": 1202}, {"id": "l08", "who": "C", "scene": "testing", "show": "That's where webapp-testing helps. We can check interactions and find problems before you publish. I ran 13 checks. 9 passed. 4 failed: the email box accepts broken addresses like just an @ sign.", "start": 40.279, "end": 53.761, "sf": 1208, "ef": 1613}, {"id": "l09", "who": "C", "scene": "testing", "show": "Skills don't make a site perfect, but they help me catch problems early.", "start": 53.981, "end": 58.136, "sf": 1619, "ef": 1744}, {"id": "l10", "who": "A", "scene": "install", "show": "Okay, I need these skills! How do I install them?", "start": 58.856, "end": 61.96, "sf": 1766, "ef": 1859}, {"id": "l11", "who": "C", "scene": "install", "show": "Open Claude Code, add Anthropic's official skill marketplace, then install the example-skills plugin.", "start": 62.18, "end": 68.826, "sf": 1865, "ef": 2065}, {"id": "l11b", "who": "C", "scene": "install", "show": "That's it. frontend-design, webapp-testing and skill-creator are now ready to use.", "start": 69.246, "end": 74.34, "sf": 2077, "ef": 2230}, {"id": "l12", "who": "A", "scene": "final", "show": "So instead of explaining everything from scratch, I can use the right skill for the job?", "start": 75.06, "end": 80.409, "sf": 2252, "ef": 2412}, {"id": "l13", "who": "C", "scene": "final", "show": "Exactly. And you can create your own reusable skills too!", "start": 80.629, "end": 83.899, "sf": 2419, "ef": 2517}, {"id": "l14", "who": "A", "scene": "end", "show": "Now that's useful!", "start": 84.819, "end": 85.927, "sf": 2545, "ef": 2578}, {"id": "l15", "who": "C", "scene": "end", "show": "Try the official Anthropic skills and see what you can build.", "start": 86.147, "end": 89.832, "sf": 2584, "ef": 2695}], "words": [{"w": "Claude!", "who": "A", "line": "l01", "s": 4, "e": 17}, {"w": "I", "who": "A", "line": "l01", "s": 17, "e": 21}, {"w": "built", "who": "A", "line": "l01", "s": 21, "e": 31}, {"w": "a", "who": "A", "line": "l01", "s": 31, "e": 35}, {"w": "website,", "who": "A", "line": "l01", "s": 35, "e": 49}, {"w": "but", "who": "A", "line": "l01", "s": 49, "e": 55}, {"w": "the", "who": "A", "line": "l01", "s": 55, "e": 62}, {"w": "design", "who": "A", "line": "l01", "s": 62, "e": 73}, {"w": "looks", "who": "A", "line": "l01", "s": 73, "e": 83}, {"w": "terrible.", "who": "A", "line": "l01", "s": 83, "e": 98}, {"w": "And", "who": "A", "line": "l01", "s": 98, "e": 105}, {"w": "I", "who": "A", "line": "l01", "s": 105, "e": 109}, {"w": "don't", "who": "A", "line": "l01", "s": 109, "e": 119}, {"w":